  "description": "One day, my bias suddenly appeared in front of my eyes. I thought I was finally getting rid of my title as the 'unlucky fangirl\". Little did I know, the first thing my bias said to me was, \"Stop bullying her.\" My bias was as cold as ice, and next to him was the tragic heroine, 'Rahee'. When there's a heroine, there's always a viallaness. But that villaness is.... me? I ended up as a villain in a fan ficition overnight.\n\nThis is not what I asked for! I want to go back!\n\n(Source: POCKETCOMICS)",
